t":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":750620401,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":1282395842,"text":"まだいるのか、勇士よ。","nextNodeIds":[750620402]},{"nodeId":750620402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":2433989274,"text":"かつて、とある学者が言った——この灰燼の都の残虐な主は、アビスの侵食を止める方法を持っていると。それで我々は…","nextNodeIds":[750620403]},{"nodeId":750620403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":3792012514,"text":"だが、ここは実に不気味だ。この頃そう思えてきた。何かがおかしい、とな。","nextNodeIds":[750620404]},{"nodeId":750620404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":1626927266,"text":"昨日まで綺麗だった道が次の日にはボロボロになっている…あの石造りの家は初めからあんな風だったか？もっと…まともだった気がするんだ。","nextNodeIds":[750620405]},{"nodeId":750620405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":479731402,"text":"それから、目が覚めたら、二度と現れるはずのない友人を見ることもある…あれは魔物だったんだろうか？友人の姿に化けた魔物だったのかもな。","nextNodeIds":[750620406]},{"nodeId":750620406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":1083712346,"text":"私の…私の責務は、ここの魔物を片付けることだ。だが、なぜ…そうしなければならない…？","nextNodeIds":[750620407]},{"nodeId":750620407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21680,"speakerName":"クエニン","textMapHash":883460330,"text":"とにかく、ここはおかしいんだ…早く離れたほうがいい。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7506205,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["7504101","6","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime"